From 0cdec47561a64e0b15b96283a1a9c65e4dfbb9f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:31:04 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(goals): Goals page and goal detail on web and desktop

Sidebar entry Goals (after Projects). List: off track / at risk / on track /
update due tiles, goal tree with progress, health and pace, measured by and
linked work; New goal form. Detail: big number, chart of actual values
against the needed line, enter a value with a note, linked issues, history.
Core: goals api client methods with zod schemas, queries and mutations.

Patch-Id: goals-ui
